        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>Portal</i>'s physics-based puzzles, <i>SWAP</i> is a first-person puzzle game, offering a fresh take on the genre. Players navigate through complex puzzles using the Swap gun to switch places with monoliths, trip pressure plates, open doors, and pass through force fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features 20 puzzles full of complex swap and physics based mechanics. A smooth difficulty progression will take you from simple problems to truly complex challenges. The mechanics are designed to be intuitive, so there's no tutorial pop-ups getting in the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoyed Portal's challenges, and mechanics, <i>SWAP</i> offers a similar experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
